        <activityName xml:lang="en">Steel, converter, low-alloyed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Steel, converter, low-alloyed, at plant
This process produces primary steel. Scrap is only used for cooling the liquid steel.;
UUID: c801854a-3e5e-3243-a4c0-4a3fcd7f54a3
Transports of hot metal and other input materials to converter, steel making process and casting.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: EU technology mix (mainly LD converter)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c801854a-3e5e-3243-a4c0-4a3fcd7f54a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
